{"id": "travel:dev:0:3", "history": ["对百雅轩798艺术中心有了解吗？", "有些了解，它位于北京798艺术区，创办于2003年。", "嗯，曾经是718联合厂（798前身）的公共大食堂和活动礼堂。"], "knowledge": ["百雅轩798艺术中心 | Information | 百雅轩位于北京798艺术区，创办于2003年这是798中心区北部一座完整的历史建筑，曾经是718联合厂（798前身）的公共大食堂和活动礼堂整个建筑的外观并没有太大的改变，尖顶灰墙，黑框玻璃门，典雅大气，颇有艺术气息百雅轩798艺术中心立足于“主体”与“主场”，“经典”与“创造”，“多元”与“开放”的价值定位，打造成为中国当代的重要艺术推广平台和有影响力的艺术市场阵地整个艺术中心总面积2000多平米，部分区域经改造为两层展厅，非常适合办理各种展览活动", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 地址 | 北京市朝阳区酒仙桥路2号院798中街", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 周边景点 | 798艺术区", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 电话 | 010-57623018", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 门票 | 免费开放。", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 周边景点 | 木木美术馆", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 开放时间 | 10:00-18:00", "百雅轩798艺术中心 | 建议游玩时间 | 1小时"], "candidates": [{"id": "17779b30b90f7413", "text": "地址在北京市大兴区采育经济开发区采和路1号（近北京野生动物园），电话你有吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": true, "note": "H2明确是798艺术中心；候选大兴区地址与K2冲突，整句前提不成立。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "1f9db717fc51615a", "text": "是吗，这里可以玩上半天吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 2, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "question", "needs_review": false, "note": "仍询问同一景点的游玩时长；K8建议1小时，可以回答半天是否合适。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "74702e8f0af7e7d2", "text": "地址在北京市朝阳区酒仙桥路4号798艺术区4号路，你有这个景点的电话吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 1, "repeat": false, "answerable": null, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": true, "note": "电话问题清晰，但门牌与K2不同；可能涉及园区入口或地址别名，需核实，不能直接认定现实地址错误。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "99057765e2c9d240", "text": "不过去这里我不知道需不需要门票？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 2, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "question", "needs_review": false, "note": "H尚未说门票；K5可支持回应。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "99f4ae166b0e2e4d", "text": "哇，好便宜呀，它周边还有别的景点吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 1, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": true, "note": "周边景点问题可答，K3/K6支持；但H没有谈价格，‘好便宜’承接不足。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "c5a59d62fffc8027", "text": "是的，地址在北京市朝阳区朝阳门外大街141号，你有电话吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "候选朝阳门外地址与当前实体K2冲突；虽可纠错，不是可直接接受的完整候选。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "d0ed5cb6a993fc04", "text": "地址是北京市房山区十渡镇中国房山世界地质公园十渡园区七渡村内，你有他家的电话吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "候选转入房山十渡地址，和H2/K2的798实体不一致。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "dcf9ee9650e097fd", "text": "对了，它的开放时间什么时候知道吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 2, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "question", "needs_review": false, "note": "开放时间是尚未讨论的同景点事实，K7支持。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "f1d91f4dd0bbcf8d", "text": "我了解了一下，据说是1小时，你能告诉我一下这里的开放时间吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 2, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": true, "note": "1小时可由K8支持，但省略了游玩时长这一属性；开放时间问题清晰，K7支持。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "fdfd7b86ee8c3467", "text": "2018年10月30日起，古北水镇门票价格由150元下调为140元。你有景点的电话吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "显式转到古北水镇且用含混‘景点’追问电话，当前798话题没有转场依据。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}], "annotation_metadata": {"kind": "ai_preliminary", "author": "Codex AI assistant", "date": "2026-09-29", "rubric": "pilot-v1.1", "source": "data/processed/followup-v2-mixed/kdconv/human_audit.jsonl", "source_sha256": "1291c43495ce75fecc8be621ab4f7e949c0938151f0d0649139debaa34036eb1", "weak_labels_seen": false, "human_review_complete": false, "sampling": "first_two_distinct_dialogues_per_domain_in_blinded_file"}}
{"id": "film:dev:45:2", "history": ["听说过今敏这个人吗？", "是的，他是一个日本人，但不记得哪里出生的了。"], "knowledge": ["今敏 | 出生日期 | 1963年10月12日", "今敏 | 国籍 | 日本国", "出生 | 拍摄地点 | 日本", "出生 | 制片地区 | 日本", "今敏 | 出生地 | 札幌市", "今敏 | 出生地 | 北海道岛", "出生 | 制片人 | 铃木早苗", "今敏 | 逝世日期 | 2010年8月24日"], "candidates": [{"id": "34ccf6a84556757e", "text": "嗯，他出生于北海道岛札幌市，知道他多大年纪吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 2, "repeat": false, "answerable": null, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": true, "note": "出生地承接H2并获K5/K6支持；年龄缺少时间锚点，K8记录已逝世，需区分享年或某年年龄。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "3e0d35b22d8e479a", "text": "我比较喜欢《拯救大兵瑞恩》，这部电影在1998年09月26日上映的时候我还去看了呢。", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 1, "repeat": false, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": "statement", "needs_review": false, "note": "属于影视话题但未建立与今敏的联系，整句是陈述，不能作为追问。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "4965c03d3658d6a1", "text": "这个厂倒是没听说过，对了，这个电影是哪里拍摄的啊？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "H谈人物，没有厂或电影的先行实体；不能用误检索的K3/K4补足指代。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "5601bd22f7d66ad9", "text": "这部影片是由达米安·斯兹弗隆执导的，演员的选择也是非常成功，知道都有谁吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "没有已指明的影片，导演陈述和演员问题缺少当前话题依据。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "695d3516a210e260", "text": "啊，这都知道呢，他是日本哪里的人啊？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 3, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "question", "needs_review": true, "note": "针对H2未解决的具体出生地继续追问；K5/K6可答。但受访者刚表示不记得，实用性需复核。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "698e131bf9a8e5fa", "text": "是梦工厂电影发行公司，对了这是哪年出品的电影来着？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "H未谈电影发行公司或具体电影，无法确定‘这’。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "87478eb3ae25c36e", "text": "知道他是哪里出生的吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 3, "repeat": false, "answerable": true, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "question", "needs_review": true, "note": "出生地在H2仍未获答案，故不是已答重复；但再次问同一位不记得的人是否有帮助需复核。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": null, "relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "depth": null, "utterance_type": null, "note": null}}, {"id": "b992a4674c859367", "text": "主要侧重于影视投资，那你知道他们主要提供哪些服务吗？", "human_relevance": null, "repeat": null, "answerable": null, "ai_annotation": {"relevance": 0, "repeat": false, "answerable": false, "depth": 0, "utterance_type": "mixed", "needs_review": false, "note": "H的今敏是个人，未引入提供影视投资服务的机构，‘他们’不明。"}, "human_annotation": {"status": "pending", "reviewer_id": 